---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import TravelCTA from "../components/TravelCTA.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cosmetic & Plastic Surgery Coordination in India | CareBridge Health"
  description="CareBridge Health helps international patients access safe cosmetic and plastic surgery in India with trusted surgeons, accredited hospitals and end-to-end support."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-900">
      Cosmetic & Plastic Surgery in India
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-10">
      CareBridge Health works with selected cosmetic and plastic surgeons in
      India to help international patients plan safe procedures with clear
      expectations, realistic results and proper after-care.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Procedures We Commonly Coordinate</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>Body contouring: liposuction, tummy tuck (abdominoplasty)</li>
        <li>Breast procedures: augmentation, reduction, lift</li>
        <li>Rhinoplasty (nose reshaping)</li>
        <li>Facial rejuvenation procedures (surgical and non-surgical)</li>
        <li>Scar revisions and reconstructive surgeries (case-to-case)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Safety & Realistic Expectations</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        Cosmetic surgery is elective but still major medical treatment. We
        prioritise safety, honest counselling and realistic results over
        aggressive sales promises.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>
          Surgeries planned only at centres with proper OT, ICU backup and
          anaesthesia support.
        </li>
        <li>
          Thorough pre-operative evaluation and fitness checks as needed.
        </li>
        <li>
          Clear discussion about scars, downtime and limitations before you travel.
        </li>
        <li>
          Written treatment plan and estimated cost shared in advance.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">How We Plan Your Cosmetic Procedure</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Initial enquiry:</strong> You share photos and what change you are
          looking for.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Surgeon review:</strong> Specialist reviews your case, may ask for
          more images or reports.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Treatment options:</strong> We send recommended procedure(s),
          risks, estimated stay and budget.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Trip planning:</strong> We coordinate admission, surgery date,
          hotel and airport pickup.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Post-op care:</strong> Follow-up visits in India and online
          reviews after you return home.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Cosmetic Surgery FAQ</h2>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          How long do I need to stay after surgery?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Depends on the procedure. Smaller procedures may need 5–7 days,
          larger body contouring surgeries might need 10–14 days. The surgeon
          will suggest the safe minimum based on your case.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Can I combine multiple procedures in one trip?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Sometimes yes, but only if it is safe from an anaesthesia and
          recovery point of view. This is decided strictly by the treating
          team, not by budget alone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Do you guarantee cosmetic results?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          No ethical surgeon can promise a specific “look”. We help you
          understand what improvement is realistic for your body type and
          health, and connect you with surgeons who follow this approach.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 px-6 py-6 md:px-8 md:py-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">
          Considering cosmetic surgery in India?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Share your concerns and target areas privately over WhatsApp. We’ll
          arrange a detailed opinion from a trusted cosmetic surgeon in India.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/919080553616"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-700"
        >
          Talk to our team on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <TravelCTA />
  </main>
</Layout>